name rojud
category Package
revision 56895
shortdesc A font with the images of the counties of Romania
longdesc This package provides a Type 1 font with images of the 42
longdesc counties of Romania, constructed using a general method which
longdesc is described in detail in the documentation. The package name
longdesc is an abbreviation of "judetele Romaniei" (= counties of
longdesc Romania).
